<title>USA: Cash America gets 6.9 mln shrs in bid.</title>
<headline>Cash America gets 6.9 mln shrs in bid.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cash America International Inc said Friday that 6,927,017 common shares were tendered in a &quot;Dutch Auction&quot; at prices of up to $8.50 per share.</p>
<p>The company said it has purchased 4.5 million shares of its common stock at $8.50 per share. The final proration factor for the tender offer is 64.96 percent, it said.</p>
<p>Cash America provides secured, non-recourse loans to individuals, commonly known as pawn loans.</p>
</text>
